<title>USA: Louis Dreyfus Nat Gas delays stock offering.</title>
<headline>Louis Dreyfus Nat Gas delays stock offering.</headline>
<dateline>OKLAHOMA CITY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Louis Dreyfus Natural Gas Corp said on Friday that it has delayed an offering of stock by the company and its majority shareholder, SA Louis Dreyfus et Cie, due to unfavorable market conditions for shares of energy companies.</p>
<p>Louis Dreyfus said it will commence the offering when market conditions improve.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk   212-859-1610))</p>
